{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_090_1000_031tom", "source_sha256": "e02d0f0d97312e56aa6b148cc2c0b706495f37e8b95906be029594a0f58a1d19", "ja": "最近、忙しいですね～。それだけ\n私たちが必要とされている、\nということかもしれませんが～。", "zh": "最近好忙啊～。这或许说明\n大家都需要我们，\n也说不定呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_090_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "83fb9d70be3c57d084b2293e43ed8fce1fd4d06f68b6a5b77f9c21b108e55b5e", "ja": "そうだね、劇場の外のオファーも\n増えてきてるし……。アイドル\nとして、成長できてるのかも！", "zh": "是啊，剧场外的邀约也越来越多了……作为偶像，我们或许也在不断成长吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_090_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "999023751757016450d3fb945e70aa0f40e619901da1f32973b77c582428bc37", "ja": "むー、{$P$}も\n忙しそうだよね。最近デートして\nくれないの～。つまんない。", "zh": "唔——{$P$}\n好像也很忙呢。最近都不跟人家\n约会了～真无聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_090_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "0580016d36fc00845b5375bd2761918ca86d8da6785c37b06e0d9983c486a3cb", "ja": "で、デートって、アイドルが\nそういうのは……って、あれ？\n美希ちゃん、最近って……？", "zh": "话说，约会什么的，偶像做那种事……咦？  \n美希，你刚才说“最近”……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_090_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "ac5e5b771defedb1cdf4f98e9b918b64147f0a0ec13703c6c704f4d525027cc6", "ja": "……。\nこれは少々、お灸をすえる\n必要がありますね～？　うふふ。", "zh": "……看来得稍微给你点教训了呢～？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
